2026-01-04T02:24:17.6192950Z       ### 3. Research Integration Pipeline
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6193238Z       
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6193544Z       **File**: `scripts/cognitive/research_integration_pipeline.py` (11.7KB)
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6193938Z       
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6194137Z       **Implementation Highlights**:
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6194400Z       
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6194577Z       ```python
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6194792Z       #!/usr/bin/env python3
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6195028Z       """
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6195233Z       Research Integration Pipeline
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6195606Z       Monitors latest research papers and integrates relevant findings
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6195974Z       """
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6196149Z       
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6196334Z       import arxiv
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6196563Z       from typing import Dict, List, Any
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6196839Z       import re
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6197032Z       
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6197249Z       class ResearchIntegrationPipeline:
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6197541Z           def __init__(self):
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6197792Z               self.domains = [
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6198048Z                   "causal inference",
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6198321Z                   "meta-learning",
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6198583Z                   "explainable AI",
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6198849Z                   "multi-agent systems",
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6199126Z                   "autonomous systems"
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6199381Z               ]
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6199598Z               self.integration_queue = []
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6199865Z               
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6200069Z           def monitor_arxiv(
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6200304Z               self,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6200522Z               lookback_days: int = 14
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6200795Z           ) -> List[Dict[str, Any]]:
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6201084Z               """Monitor arXiv for relevant papers"""
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6201386Z               papers = []
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6201842Z               
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6202067Z               for domain in self.domains:
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6202360Z                   search = arxiv.Search(
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6202633Z                       query=domain,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6202890Z                       max_results=50,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6203196Z                       sort_by=arxiv.SortCriterion.SubmittedDate
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6203509Z                   )
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6203708Z                   
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6203935Z                   for result in search.results():
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6204287Z                       if self._is_recent(result.published, lookback_days):
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6204630Z                           papers.append({
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6204925Z                               "title": result.title,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6205253Z                               "authors": [a.name for a in result.authors],
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6205588Z                               "abstract": result.summary,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6205912Z                               "pdf_url": result.pdf_url,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6206359Z                               "published": result.published,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6206666Z                               "domain": domain
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6206940Z                           })
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6207174Z                           
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6207405Z               return papers
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6207635Z               
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6207840Z           def score_relevance(
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6208078Z               self,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6208293Z               paper: Dict[str, Any]
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6208550Z           ) -> float:
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6208803Z               """Score paper relevance to cognitive brain"""
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6209117Z               relevance_keywords = {
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6209386Z                   "causal": 0.3,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6209647Z                   "counterfactual": 0.25,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6209938Z                   "explainability": 0.25,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6210220Z                   "meta-learning": 0.3,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6210506Z                   "multi-agent": 0.2,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6210770Z                   "autonomous": 0.2,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6211035Z                   "self-healing": 0.15,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6211307Z                   "coalition": 0.15
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6211548Z               }
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6211841Z               
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6212120Z               text = paper["title"].lower() + " " + paper["abstract"].lower()
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6212468Z               
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6212668Z               score = 0.0
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6212949Z               for keyword, weight in relevance_keywords.items():
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6213284Z                   if keyword in text:
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6213554Z                       score += weight
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6213800Z                       
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6214023Z               return min(score, 1.0)
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6214275Z               
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6214496Z           def assess_integration_feasibility(
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6214781Z               self,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6214996Z               paper: Dict[str, Any]
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6215257Z           ) -> Dict[str, Any]:
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6215544Z               """Assess feasibility of integrating research"""
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6215902Z               relevance_score = self.score_relevance(paper)
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6216207Z               
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6216445Z               # Estimate implementation effort
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6216904Z               complexity_indicators = ["novel", "state-of-the-art", "complex", "advanced"]
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6217325Z               complexity_count = sum(
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6217623Z                   1 for indicator in complexity_indicators 
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6217952Z                   if indicator in paper["abstract"].lower()
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6218242Z               )
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6218553Z               
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6219316Z               effort = "low" if complexity_count <= 1 else "medium" if complexity_count <= 3 else "high"
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6219748Z               
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6219972Z               # Check for existing implementations
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6220424Z               has_code = "github" in paper["abstract"].lower() or "code" in paper["abstract"].lower()
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6220845Z               
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6221050Z               assessment = {
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6221318Z                   "relevance_score": relevance_score,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6221732Z                   "estimated_effort": effort,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6222025Z                   "has_existing_code": has_code,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6222420Z                   "recommended": relevance_score > 0.5 and effort in ["low", "medium"],
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6222975Z                   "priority": "high" if relevance_score > 0.7 else "medium" if relevance_score > 0.5 else "low"
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6223414Z               }
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6223607Z               
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6223809Z               return assessment
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6224189Z               
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6224403Z           def generate_integration_roadmap(
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6224680Z               self,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6224897Z               papers: List[Dict[str, Any]]
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6238570Z           ) -> Dict[str, Any]:
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6238903Z               """Generate roadmap for integrating research"""
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6239257Z               recommended_papers = [
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6239550Z                   p for p in papers 
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6239903Z                   if self.assess_integration_feasibility(p)["recommended"]
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6240252Z               ]
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6240456Z               
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6240683Z               # Sort by priority and feasibility
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6240995Z               recommended_papers.sort(
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6241290Z                   key=lambda p: (
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6241765Z                       self.assess_integration_feasibility(p)["relevance_score"],
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6242300Z                       -{"low": 1, "medium": 2, "high": 3}[self.assess_integration_feasibility(p)["estimated_effort"]]
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6242731Z                   ),
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6242954Z                   reverse=True
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6243197Z               )
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6243396Z               
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6243600Z               roadmap = {
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6243878Z                   "total_papers_reviewed": len(papers),
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6244255Z                   "recommended_for_integration": len(recommended_papers),
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6244666Z                   "integration_queue": recommended_papers[:10],  # Top 10
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6245128Z                   "estimated_timeline": self._estimate_timeline(recommended_papers[:10])
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6245517Z               }
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6245708Z               
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6245920Z               return roadmap
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6246161Z       ```
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6246353Z       
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6246551Z       **Key Features**:
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6246929Z       - ✅ Bi-weekly arXiv monitoring
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6247246Z       - ✅ Relevance scoring
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6247529Z       - ✅ Feasibility assessment
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6247823Z       - ✅ Integration roadmap
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6248121Z       - ✅ 12+ papers/year target
