2026-01-04T02:24:17.6274713Z               rating: int,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6274966Z               feedback: Optional[str] = None
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6275241Z           ):
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6275453Z               """Rate a public pattern"""
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6275755Z               if pattern_id not in self.ratings:
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6276147Z                   self.ratings[pattern_id] = {"ratings": [], "average": 0.0, "count": 0}
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6276527Z                   
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6276774Z               self.ratings[pattern_id]["ratings"].append({
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6277087Z                   "user": user,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6277343Z                   "rating": rating,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6277620Z                   "feedback": feedback,
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6277919Z                   "timestamp": datetime.now().isoformat()
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6278212Z               })
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6278413Z               
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6278619Z               # Recalculate average
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6278986Z               all_ratings = [r["rating"] for r in self.ratings[pattern_id]["ratings"]]
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6279439Z               self.ratings[pattern_id]["average"] = np.mean(all_ratings)
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6279851Z               self.ratings[pattern_id]["count"] = len(all_ratings)
2026-01-04T02:24:17.6280172Z       ```
