2026-01-04T02:24:51.9138964Z     1. # 🎵 Audio Cleaner 🎵  
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9139375Z     2. 
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9141016Z     3. Audio Cleaner is a versatile Python application capable of cleaning audio files, extracting audio metadata, and auto-selecting cleaning profiles via audio clustering. It now also supports extracting audio directly from MP4 video files!
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9142397Z     4. 
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9142620Z     5. ---
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9142817Z     6. 
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9143105Z     7. ## 🚀 **Installation**
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9143356Z     8. 
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9143535Z     9. ```
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9143754Z     10. pip install -r requirements.txt
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9144049Z     11. ```
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9144236Z     12. 
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9144416Z     13. ---
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9144596Z     14. 
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9144847Z     15. ## 🌟 **Feature Highlights:**
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9145144Z     16. - Silence Trimming  
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9145669Z     17. - High-pass filters and Normalization  
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9145995Z     18. - Noise gating  
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9146382Z     19. - Metadata extraction (Pitch, RMS, Spectral Centroid, Zero Crossing Rate)  
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9146867Z     20. - Clustering-based auto-profile matching  
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9147297Z     21. - **Supported formats**: WAV, MP3, FLAC, and MP4 (audio extraction)  
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9147726Z     22. - GUI and CLI interfaces provided  
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9148032Z     23. 
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9148224Z     24. ---
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9148415Z     25. 
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9148674Z     26. ## 🎨 **GUI Mode (Drag-and-Drop)**
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9148956Z     27. 
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9149157Z     28. Run GUI mode simply by:
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9149591Z     29. 
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9149860Z     30. ```
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9150163Z     31. python main.py
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9150495Z     32. ```
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9150780Z     33. 
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9151125Z     34. - Drag-and-drop audio or MP4 video files  
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9152077Z     35. - Select cleaning profiles manually or auto-select via clustering  
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9153119Z     36. - View extracted audio metadata  
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9153580Z     37. 
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9153847Z     38. ---
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9154140Z     39. 
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9154558Z     40. ## 🔧 **Command-Line Mode**
2026-01-04T02:24:51.9154980Z     41. 
