2026-01-04T02:25:03.8182112Z     6. class ClusteringEngine:
2026-01-04T02:25:03.8182509Z     7.     def __init__(self, profiles_folder='./templates'):
2026-01-04T02:25:03.8182897Z     8.         # Ensure templates directory exists
2026-01-04T02:25:03.8183252Z     9.         os.makedirs(profiles_folder, exist_ok=True)
2026-01-04T02:25:03.8183565Z     10.         
