2026-01-04T02:27:11.3010114Z       ### 1. Core Audio Processing (Agent 8 - ML Engineering)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3010445Z       
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3010765Z       **File**: `src/core/audio_processor.py` (12.4KB)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3011326Z       
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3011793Z       **Key Improvements**:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3012225Z       ```python
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3012575Z       class AudioProcessor:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3013365Z           """Production-grade audio processor with streaming support"""
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3013993Z           
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3014364Z           def __init__(self, config: AudioConfig):
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3014886Z               self.config = config
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3015370Z               self.effects_chain = EffectsChain()
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3015914Z               self.validator = AudioValidator()
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3016400Z               
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3016734Z           def process_file(
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3017127Z               self,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3017478Z               input_path: Path,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3017919Z               output_path: Path,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3018385Z               profile: ProcessingProfile,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3018910Z               callback: Optional[Callable] = None
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3019426Z           ) -> ProcessingResult:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3019934Z               """Process audio file with progress tracking"""
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3020467Z               try:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3020827Z                   # Validate input
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3021327Z                   self.validator.validate_file(input_path)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3022189Z                   
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3022574Z                   # Load with streaming for large files
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3023173Z                   with StreamingAudioLoader(input_path) as loader:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3023734Z                       chunks = []
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3024210Z                       total_chunks = loader.get_chunk_count()
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3024719Z                       
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3025124Z                       for i, chunk in enumerate(loader):
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3025643Z                           # Process chunk
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3026192Z                           processed = self._process_chunk(chunk, profile)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3026794Z                           chunks.append(processed)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3027284Z                           
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3027698Z                           # Progress callback
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3028191Z                           if callback:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3028683Z                               callback(i + 1, total_chunks)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3029195Z                               
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3029606Z                   # Combine chunks
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3030078Z                   final_audio = np.concatenate(chunks)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3030573Z                   
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3030922Z                   # Save with metadata
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3031514Z                   self._save_with_metadata(final_audio, output_path, profile)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3032277Z                   
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3032656Z                   return ProcessingResult(
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3033163Z                       success=True,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3033668Z                       output_path=output_path,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3034106Z                       processing_time=time.time() - start_time,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3034501Z                       quality_score=self._calculate_quality(final_audio)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3034833Z                   )
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3035038Z                   
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3035266Z               except Exception as e:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3035811Z                   logger.error(f"Processing failed: {e}")
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3036441Z                   return ProcessingResult(success=False, error=str(e))
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3037022Z                   
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3037368Z           def _process_chunk(
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3037773Z               self,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3038138Z               audio: np.ndarray,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3038599Z               profile: ProcessingProfile
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3039081Z           ) -> np.ndarray:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3039519Z               """Apply effects chain to audio chunk"""
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3040045Z               # Apply effects in order
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3040540Z               for effect in profile.effects:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3041300Z                   audio = self.effects_chain.apply(audio, effect)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3042030Z                   
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3042381Z               return audio
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3042773Z       ```
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3043077Z       
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3043377Z       **Features**:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3043943Z       - ✅ Streaming for large files (memory efficient)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3044578Z       - ✅ Progress tracking with callbacks
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3045163Z       - ✅ Comprehensive error handling
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3045690Z       - ✅ Quality scoring
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3046160Z       - ✅ Metadata preservation
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3046661Z       - ✅ Type hints throughout
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3047157Z       - ✅ Logging at all levels
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3047555Z       
