2026-01-04T02:27:11.3049899Z       
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3050220Z       **Enhanced Features**:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3050813Z       ```python
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3051166Z       class FeatureExtractor:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3051953Z           """Extract comprehensive audio features for ML clustering"""
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3052564Z           
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3052896Z           def extract_all_features(
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3053325Z               self,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3053687Z               audio: np.ndarray,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3054096Z               sr: int
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3054338Z           ) -> AudioFeatures:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3054611Z               """Extract complete feature set"""
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3054926Z               return AudioFeatures(
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3055205Z                   # Temporal features
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3055507Z                   rms=librosa.feature.rms(y=audio),
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3055860Z                   zcr=librosa.feature.zero_crossing_rate(audio),
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3056192Z                   
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3056416Z                   # Spectral features
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3056821Z                   spectral_centroid=librosa.feature.spectral_centroid(y=audio, sr=sr),
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3057359Z                   spectral_rolloff=librosa.feature.spectral_rolloff(y=audio, sr=sr),
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3057879Z                   spectral_contrast=librosa.feature.spectral_contrast(y=audio, sr=sr),
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3058273Z                   
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3058491Z                   # Rhythm features
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3058805Z                   tempo=librosa.beat.tempo(y=audio, sr=sr)[0],
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3059117Z                   
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3059331Z                   # Pitch features
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3059632Z                   pitch=self._extract_pitch(audio, sr),
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3060011Z                   pitch_confidence=self._get_pitch_confidence(audio, sr),
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3060357Z                   
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3060562Z                   # MFCCs
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3060871Z                   mfcc=librosa.feature.mfcc(y=audio, sr=sr, n_mfcc=13),
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3061215Z                   
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3061426Z                   # Quality metrics
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3061963Z                   snr=self._calculate_snr(audio),
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3062323Z                   dynamic_range=self._calculate_dynamic_range(audio),
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3062711Z                   clipping_detected=self._detect_clipping(audio)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3063032Z               )
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3063226Z       ```
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3063430Z       
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3063635Z       **Improvements over Beta**:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3063910Z       - 12 features vs 4 in beta
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3064184Z       - Quality metrics included
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3064455Z       - Pitch confidence scoring
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3064722Z       - Clipping detection
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3064966Z       - SNR calculation
