2026-01-04T02:27:11.3065948Z       ### 3. ML-Enhanced Clustering (Agent 8)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3066244Z       
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3066484Z       **File**: `src/analysis/clustering_engine.py` (9.3KB)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3066792Z       
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3067069Z       **Smart Profile Matching**:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3067426Z       ```python
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3067653Z       class ClusteringEngine:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3068018Z           """ML-powered profile auto-selection with confidence scoring"""
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3068386Z           
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3068618Z           def __init__(self, profiles_dir: Path):
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3068981Z               self.profiles = self._load_profiles(profiles_dir)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3069333Z               self.model = self._train_model()
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3069647Z               self.scaler = StandardScaler()
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3069930Z               
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3070151Z           def auto_select_profile(
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3070415Z               self,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3070780Z               features: AudioFeatures,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3071079Z               return_confidence: bool = True
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3071376Z           ) -> ProfileMatch:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3071904Z               """Auto-select best profile with confidence score"""
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3072252Z               # Normalize features
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3072566Z               feature_vector = self._features_to_vector(features)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3072966Z               normalized = self.scaler.transform([feature_vector])
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3073304Z               
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3073520Z               # Predict cluster
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3073823Z               cluster_id = self.model.predict(normalized)[0]
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3074143Z               
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3074371Z               # Get probability distribution
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3074742Z               probabilities = self.model.predict_proba(normalized)[0]
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3075136Z               confidence = probabilities[cluster_id]
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3075445Z               
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3075655Z               # Get profile
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3075928Z               profile = self.profiles[cluster_id]
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3076222Z               
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3076472Z               # Alternative suggestions if confidence low
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3076795Z               alternatives = []
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3077055Z               if confidence < 0.7:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3077478Z                   top_3_indices = np.argsort(probabilities)[-3:][::-1]
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3077864Z                   alternatives = [
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3078138Z                       ProfileMatch(
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3078434Z                           profile=self.profiles[idx],
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3078771Z                           confidence=probabilities[idx],
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3079154Z                           reason=self._explain_match(features, self.profiles[idx])
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3079522Z                       )
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3079800Z                       for idx in top_3_indices[1:]  # Skip top match
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3080113Z                   ]
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3080320Z                   
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3080540Z               return ProfileMatch(
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3080808Z                   profile=profile,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3081084Z                   confidence=confidence,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3081390Z                   alternatives=alternatives,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3081826Z                   reason=self._explain_match(features, profile)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3082140Z               )
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3082338Z               
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3082557Z           def _explain_match(
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3082807Z               self,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3083038Z               features: AudioFeatures,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3083340Z               profile: ProcessingProfile
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3083620Z           ) -> str:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3084019Z               """Generate human-readable explanation using SHAP"""
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3084395Z               # Use SHAP values for explanation
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3084731Z               explainer = shap.TreeExplainer(self.model)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3085108Z               feature_vector = self._features_to_vector(features)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3085509Z               shap_values = explainer.shap_values([feature_vector])
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3085840Z               
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3086066Z               # Get top 3 contributing features
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3086450Z               top_features = np.argsort(np.abs(shap_values[0]))[-3:][::-1]
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3086803Z               
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3087079Z               explanation = f"Matched to '{profile.name}' because:\n"
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3087437Z               for idx in top_features:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3087742Z                   feature_name = self.feature_names[idx]
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3088093Z                   contribution = shap_values[0][idx]
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3088492Z                   explanation += f"- {feature_name}: {contribution:.2f} influence\n"
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3088993Z                   
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3089215Z               return explanation
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3089470Z       ```
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3089657Z       
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3089855Z       **Key Enhancements**:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3090183Z       - ✅ Confidence scoring
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3090497Z       - ✅ Alternative suggestions
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3090864Z       - ✅ SHAP-based explanations (Agent 3 integration)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3091251Z       - ✅ Normalization for better accuracy
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3091696Z       - ✅ Support for 15+ profiles
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3091961Z       
