2026-01-04T02:27:11.3092545Z       ### 4. Advanced Noise Reduction (Agent 8)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3092831Z       
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3093075Z       **File**: `src/effects/noise_reduction.py` (13.6KB)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3093397Z       
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3093614Z       **Professional-Grade Algorithms**:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3093908Z       ```python
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3094127Z       class NoiseReduction:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3094438Z           """Advanced noise reduction with multiple algorithms"""
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3094761Z           
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3094965Z           def __init__(self):
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3095228Z               self.algorithms = {
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3095523Z                   'spectral_gating': self._spectral_gating,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3095851Z                   'wiener': self._wiener_filter,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3096174Z                   'deep_learning': self._dl_noise_reduction
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3096471Z               }
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3096670Z               
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3096876Z           def reduce_noise(
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3097111Z               self,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3097339Z               audio: np.ndarray,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3097596Z               sr: int,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3097846Z               method: str = 'spectral_gating',
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3098153Z               **kwargs
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3098378Z           ) -> np.ndarray:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3098638Z               """Apply noise reduction"""
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3098937Z               if method not in self.algorithms:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3099281Z                   raise ValueError(f"Unknown method: {method}")
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3099596Z                   
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3099864Z               return self.algorithms[method](audio, sr, **kwargs)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3100187Z               
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3100398Z           def _spectral_gating(
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3100646Z               self,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3100865Z               audio: np.ndarray,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3101112Z               sr: int,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3101349Z               threshold_db: float = -40,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3101720Z               **kwargs
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3101946Z           ) -> np.ndarray:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3102328Z               """Spectral gating noise reduction"""
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3102659Z               # Convert to frequency domain
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3102954Z               D = librosa.stft(audio)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3103262Z               magnitude, phase = librosa.magphase(D)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3103554Z               
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3103794Z               # Estimate noise profile from quiet sections
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3104169Z               noise_profile = self._estimate_noise_profile(magnitude)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3104510Z               
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3104720Z               # Create gate mask
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3105080Z               mask = magnitude > (noise_profile * self._db_to_linear(threshold_db))
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3105463Z               
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3105682Z               # Apply mask with smoothing
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3105995Z               smoothed_mask = self._smooth_mask(mask)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3106288Z               
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3106498Z               # Reconstruct
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3106788Z               D_filtered = magnitude * smoothed_mask * phase
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3107258Z               return librosa.istft(D_filtered)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3107538Z       ```
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3107727Z       
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3107922Z       **Improvements**:
