2026-01-04T02:27:11.3188223Z       ### 10. Cognitive Brain Integration
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3188506Z       
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3188709Z       **Continuous Improvement Loop**:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3189104Z       ```python
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3189335Z       # Integration with cognitive brain
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3189755Z       from scripts.cognitive.meta_learning_engine import MetaLearningEngine
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3190273Z       from scripts.cognitive.self_healing_engine import SelfHealingEngine
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3190647Z       
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3190861Z       class CognitiveBrainIntegration:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3191199Z           """Integrate audio cleaner with cognitive brain"""
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3191517Z           
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3191818Z           def __init__(self):
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3192110Z               self.meta_learning = MetaLearningEngine()
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3192451Z               self.self_healing = SelfHealingEngine()
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3192749Z               
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3192957Z           def learn_from_usage(
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3193207Z               self,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3193463Z               processing_results: List[ProcessingResult]
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3193775Z           ):
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3194026Z               """Learn optimal parameters from user sessions"""
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3194481Z               # Extract patterns
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3194753Z               successful_params = [
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3195035Z                   r.profile.to_dict()
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3195326Z                   for r in processing_results
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3195636Z                   if r.success and r.quality_score > 0.85
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3195931Z               ]
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3196129Z               
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3196354Z               # Create meta-learning pattern
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3196645Z               pattern = {
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3196897Z                   "type": "audio_processing",
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3197261Z                   "parameters": self._aggregate_params(successful_params),
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3197738Z                   "effectiveness": np.mean([r.quality_score for r in processing_results]),
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3198213Z                   "use_cases": self._identify_use_cases(processing_results)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3198563Z               }
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3198767Z               
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3198986Z               # Store in pattern library
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3199303Z               self.meta_learning.store_pattern(pattern)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3199606Z               
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3199817Z           def auto_heal_errors(
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3200063Z               self,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3200278Z               error: Exception,
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3200539Z               context: Dict[str, Any]
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3200827Z           ) -> Optional[Dict[str, Any]]:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3201137Z               """Automatically fix common errors"""
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3201483Z               diagnosis = self.self_healing.self_diagnose({
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3201980Z                   "error": str(error),
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3202259Z                   "context": context
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3202517Z               })
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3202747Z               
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3202991Z               if diagnosis["confidence"] > 0.8:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3203359Z                   fix = self.self_healing.generate_fix(diagnosis, context)
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3203726Z                   if fix and fix["auto_apply"]:
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3204018Z                       return fix
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3204269Z                       
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3204492Z               return None
2026-01-04T02:27:11.3204721Z       ```
