2026-01-04T02:29:46.0067448Z         """
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0067669Z         # Step 1: Validate and discover files
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0068125Z         self.logger.info(f"🔍 Analyzing path: {input_path}")
