2026-01-04T02:29:46.0283520Z ### 5. Quality Validator
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0283673Z 
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0283820Z **File**: `src/validation/quality_validator.py` (8.9KB)
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0284060Z 
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0284169Z **Comprehensive Quality Checks**:
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0284435Z ```python
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0284640Z class QualityValidator:
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0284943Z     """Validates processing quality with objective metrics"""
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0285277Z     
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0285471Z     def validate_output(
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0285708Z         self,
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0285925Z         original_path: Path,
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0286186Z         processed_path: Path,
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0286461Z         expected_improvements: List[str]
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0286754Z     ) -> ValidationResult:
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0287025Z         """Comprehensive quality validation"""
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0287326Z         # Load both files
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0287678Z         original, sr_orig = librosa.load(str(original_path), sr=None, mono=True)
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0288315Z         processed, sr_proc = librosa.load(str(processed_path), sr=None, mono=True)
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0288713Z         
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0288910Z         # Calculate metrics
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0289275Z         snr_improvement = self._calculate_snr_improvement(original, processed)
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0289761Z         artifacts_detected = self._detect_artifacts(processed, sr_proc)
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0290251Z         dynamic_range_improvement = self._calculate_dynamic_range_improvement(
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0290644Z             original,
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0290865Z             processed
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0291075Z         )
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0291259Z         
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0291464Z         # Check if problems were fixed
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0291907Z         problems_fixed = self._verify_problems_fixed(
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0292218Z             original,
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0292437Z             processed,
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0292658Z             sr_proc,
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0292895Z             expected_improvements
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0293151Z         )
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0293336Z         
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0293531Z         # Overall quality score
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0293854Z         improvement_score = self._calculate_improvement_score(
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0294198Z             snr_improvement,
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0294449Z             artifacts_detected,
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0294709Z             dynamic_range_improvement,
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0294990Z             problems_fixed,
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0295245Z             len(expected_improvements)
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0295511Z         )
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0295694Z         
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0295897Z         return ValidationResult(
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0296187Z             improvement_score=improvement_score,
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0296513Z             snr_improvement=snr_improvement,
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0296832Z             artifacts_detected=artifacts_detected,
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0297195Z             dynamic_range_improvement=dynamic_range_improvement,
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0297561Z             problems_fixed=len(problems_fixed),
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0297891Z             total_problems=len(expected_improvements),
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0298222Z             passed=improvement_score >= 7.0
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0298499Z         )
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0298679Z ```
