2026-01-04T02:29:46.0362737Z ```python
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0362954Z class CognitiveAudioTuner:
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0363337Z     """Integrate audio tuner with cognitive brain for continuous improvement"""
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0363745Z     
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0363948Z     def learn_from_session(
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0364212Z         self,
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0364451Z         session_results: List[FileProcessingResult]
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0364958Z     ):
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0365220Z         """Learn optimal parameters from processing session"""
2026-01-04T02:29:46.0365572Z         # Extract successful patterns
