2026-01-04T02:29:47.4745426Z                       error=str(e)
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4745675Z                   )
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4745865Z                   
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4746124Z           def _print_progress(self, current: int, total: int):
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4746472Z               """Print processing progress"""
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4746773Z               percent = (current / total) * 100
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4747068Z               bar_length = 40
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4747344Z               filled = int(bar_length * current / total)
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4747744Z               bar = '█' * filled + '░' * (bar_length - filled)
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4748113Z               print(f"\r   [{bar}] {percent:.1f}%", end='', flush=True)
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4748452Z               if current == total:
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4748722Z                   print()  # New line when complete
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4749007Z       ```
