2026-01-04T02:29:47.4899429Z       ### 5. Quality Validator
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4899665Z       
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4899914Z       **File**: `src/validation/quality_validator.py` (8.9KB)
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4900233Z       
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4900446Z       **Comprehensive Quality Checks**:
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4900715Z       ```python
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4900932Z       class QualityValidator:
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4901249Z           """Validates processing quality with objective metrics"""
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4901583Z           
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4901906Z           def validate_output(
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4902146Z               self,
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4902365Z               original_path: Path,
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4902642Z               processed_path: Path,
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4902923Z               expected_improvements: List[str]
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4903221Z           ) -> ValidationResult:
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4903511Z               """Comprehensive quality validation"""
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4903812Z               # Load both files
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4904181Z               original, sr_orig = librosa.load(str(original_path), sr=None, mono=True)
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4904696Z               processed, sr_proc = librosa.load(str(processed_path), sr=None, mono=True)
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4905096Z               
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4905304Z               # Calculate metrics
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4905684Z               snr_improvement = self._calculate_snr_improvement(original, processed)
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4906172Z               artifacts_detected = self._detect_artifacts(processed, sr_proc)
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4906654Z               dynamic_range_improvement = self._calculate_dynamic_range_improvement(
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4907053Z                   original,
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4907292Z                   processed
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4907518Z               )
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4907713Z               
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4907931Z               # Check if problems were fixed
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4908251Z               problems_fixed = self._verify_problems_fixed(
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4908565Z                   original,
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4908947Z                   processed,
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4909195Z                   sr_proc,
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4909444Z                   expected_improvements
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4909708Z               )
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4909900Z               
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4910107Z               # Overall quality score
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4910442Z               improvement_score = self._calculate_improvement_score(
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4910790Z                   snr_improvement,
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4911050Z                   artifacts_detected,
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4911330Z                   dynamic_range_improvement,
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4911715Z                   problems_fixed,
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4911994Z                   len(expected_improvements)
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4912265Z               )
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4912457Z               
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4912668Z               return ValidationResult(
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4912968Z                   improvement_score=improvement_score,
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4913297Z                   snr_improvement=snr_improvement,
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4913620Z                   artifacts_detected=artifacts_detected,
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4914106Z                   dynamic_range_improvement=dynamic_range_improvement,
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4914464Z                   problems_fixed=len(problems_fixed),
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4914795Z                   total_problems=len(expected_improvements),
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4915126Z                   passed=improvement_score >= 7.0
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4915411Z               )
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4915605Z       ```
