2026-01-04T02:29:47.4973217Z       ### Cognitive Brain Integration
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4973480Z       
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4973745Z       **File**: `src/cognitive/cognitive_audio_tuner.py` (11.7KB)
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4974070Z       
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4974259Z       **Learning Loop**:
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4974489Z       ```python
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4974710Z       class CognitiveAudioTuner:
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4975226Z           """Integrate audio tuner with cognitive brain for continuous improvement"""
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4975634Z           
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4975846Z           def learn_from_session(
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4976098Z               self,
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4976348Z               session_results: List[FileProcessingResult]
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4976648Z           ):
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4976907Z               """Learn optimal parameters from processing session"""
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4977260Z               # Extract successful patterns
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4977550Z               successful_configs = [
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4977807Z                   {
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4978053Z                       "content_type": r.analysis.content_type,
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4978393Z                       "problems": r.analysis.problems,
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4978714Z                       "profile": r.profile.to_dict(),
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4979071Z                       "quality_improvement": r.validation.improvement_score
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4979408Z                   }
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4979634Z                   for r in session_results
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4979943Z                   if r.validation.improvement_score > 8.5
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4980354Z               ]
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4980550Z               
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4980774Z               # Group by content type and problems
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4981152Z               patterns = self._group_by_characteristics(successful_configs)
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4981508Z               
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4981830Z               # Update meta-learning patterns
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4982130Z               for pattern in patterns:
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4982425Z                   self.meta_learner.store_pattern({
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4982733Z                       "domain": "audio_processing",
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4983033Z                       "type": "optimal_parameters",
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4983328Z                       "pattern": pattern,
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4983646Z                       "effectiveness": pattern["avg_quality"],
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4983980Z                       "use_count": pattern["frequency"]
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4984269Z                   })
2026-01-04T02:29:47.4984478Z       ```
